                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "conflict",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "Diplomats are working hard to prevent any further <w>escalation</w> of the military conflict in the region."
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "The border dispute saw a dangerous <w>escalation</w> when both sides moved heavy artillery into position."
